## 👨‍💻 For Developers

### File-Based Routing
This project uses Expo Router with file-based routing. Routes are automatically generated from the `app/` directory structure.

### Adding New Topics
1. Create a new file in `app/DataStructures/` or `app/Algorithms/`
2. Add explanations and code examples
3. Create a corresponding visualizer in `app/DataVisual/`
4. Update the Learn screen topic list in `app/(tabs)/learn.tsx`

### Authentication
User authentication context is in `app/auth/AuthContext.tsx`. Supabase is configured in `lib/supabase.ts`.

### Theming
Dynamic theming is managed in `app/theme/ThemeContext.tsx`. Both light and dark themes are defined there with a full token set.

### Component Library
Reusable components live in `app/components/`:
- `Card` — flexible card with multiple variants and press animations
- `Expandables` — animated collapsible section used in Learn and Settings

